<title>USA: 4Kids Entertainment sees year profit.</title>
<headline>4Kids Entertainment sees year profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>4Kids Entertainment Inc said on Wednesday that its 1997 earnings per share are expected to exceed $0.25, compared with a loss of $0.08 a share in 1996.</p>
<p>The company's chairman Al Kahn made this projection at the company's annual shareholders meetng.</p>
<p>4Kids Entertainment has expanded its licensing program for Nintendo Co Ltd's N64 video game system, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said its 1996 results fell short of expectations due to disappointing international licensing revenues.</p>
</text>
